  "source": "[\\(inductive)::set]\nRefines: I\nsatisfies:\n. \\empty.set \"in\"? I\n. forAll: X is \\set\n  where: X \"in\"? I\n  then: \\set.successor:of{X} \"in\"? I\nDocumented:\n. adjective: \"inductive\"\n. description: \"An inductive set is a set containing the empty set and closed\n                under the set successor operation $X \\mapsto X \\cup \\{X\\}$.\"\nId: \"68ba43e9-1329-4103-819e-16e20e8e7c9f\"",
